error[E0202]: expected 'get' or 'set' after '|'
 --> $DIR/clause-word.nra:4:11
  |
4 |         | fetch: count;
  |           ^^^^^ expected 'get' or 'set', found 'fetch'
  |
  = help: an accessor clause is '| get: <expression>;' or '| set: <statement>;'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0202`.
